    "aftercare": "Recovery typically involves some swelling and a soft or liquid diet for the first few weeks while the jaw heals, with most patients returning to normal routines gradually over the following weeks. We explain your personalised recovery plan in detail beforehand and stay in contact afterwards, so you always know what is normal and who to reach.",
