      "We build our veneers from premium layered ceramic, a ceramic prized by master dental technicians for its layered, light-reflective depth. Unlike a single flat block of material, hand-layered ceramic captures the subtle translucency and warmth of natural enamel, so the veneers catch and scatter light the way real teeth do. Tooth preparation is deliberately minimal and conservative, designed to enhance your smile while preserving as much natural enamel as possible, and the ceramic surface is highly stain-resistant - it holds its colour beautifully against coffee, tea, and red wine over the years.",
