      "At Dental Med Austria, each lingual appliance is custom-made to follow the precise contours of the inner surfaces of your teeth, which improves comfort and accuracy compared with one-size-fits-all systems. Our orthodontists plan every case in detail before treatment begins, so the brackets and wires are positioned for efficient, predictable tooth movement. We work to premium clinical standards in our Tirana clinic, combining premium materials with meticulous planning to deliver results that look completely natural - because the hardware is never on show.",
