        "q": "How is a zirconia veneer different from the layered E-max versions?",
        "a": "A plain zirconia veneer is a single full-contour shell prized for maximum strength and a clean, uniform finish. Our zirconia E-max GiSi and Ivoclar veneers add hand-applied ceramic over the same strong core for extra translucency and depth, so the choice comes down to how much layered, lifelike character you want."
