      "The Straumann BLT (Bone-Level Tapered) is the flagship of Swiss implant engineering and the most clinically documented implant system in the world. Its tapered, self-tapping body is shaped to grip firmly the moment it is placed, delivering the outstanding primary stability that makes secure, predictable treatment possible - even where the bone is softer, narrower, or recently grafted. For international patients travelling to Tirana, that reliability matters: it gives your dentist confidence to plan the most efficient path to a fixed, lasting result.",
      "What sets the BLT apart is Straumann's renowned SLActive surface, a chemically active titanium finish engineered to speed and strengthen osseointegration - the natural fusion of implant and bone. This means faster, more reliable healing and a foundation built to carry your new crown or bridge for decades. The titanium itself is fully biocompatible, and the precision-machined Swiss components fit together to micron-level tolerances, which is part of why the system is trusted across millions of placements worldwide.",
      "At Dental Med Austria, every Straumann BLT is placed to premium-quality standards using digital planning, so positioning is mapped before a single instrument touches your jaw. Because the BLT performs so well in compromised bone, it is often the implant we reach for in the cases that demand the most. Before you ever travel, we provide a free written treatment plan within 24-48 hours from a panoramic X-ray and a few photos - so you arrive knowing exactly what is involved and what to expect."
