    "aftercare": "There is no downtime - you can eat and return to your day straight away, though it helps to avoid strongly staining foods and drinks like coffee, red wine, or tobacco for the first few hours while the surface is at its smoothest. A little gum tenderness may settle within a day, and gentle brushing with regular flossing keeps your teeth feeling fresh for longer.",
